RATIONALE: sunnypilot/mads/mads.py constructs StateMachine and processes button events to set custom events and silent modes.
TAGS: [domain.sunnypilot]

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SP-004
TITLE: Sunnylink Backup Coordination
STATUS: accepted
