[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SP-006
TITLE: Latency Cache Initialization
STATUS: accepted
STATEMENT: Sunnypilot shall initialize model state with cached lateral delay parameters to avoid cold-start lag spikes.
RATIONALE: sunnypilot/modeld/modeld_base.py retrieves LagdValueCache from Params during ModelStateBase initialization.
